[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mAssigned to you[39m
  [38;5;246mSomeone assigns you a task, or reassigns one away from you. Near-universally the highest-signal notification.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Comment or mention
  [38;5;246mA new comment on a task you're subscribed to, and @-mentions (which should notify even if you're not subscribed).[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Status change
  [38;5;246mTask moved between states — open, in progress, done, cancelled. Moderate signal, fires often.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Due date / field edits
  [38;5;246mDue date set or moved, title or description edited, priority changed. Lowest signal, highest volume — the usual source
[39m  [38;5;246mof notification fatigue.[39m
